      "en": "In the morning, about the time of offering the sacrifice, behold, water came by the way of Edom, and the country was filled with water.",
      "ko": "아침에 미쳐 소제 드릴 때에 물이 에돔 편에서부터 흘러와서 그 땅에 가득하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "e11aa2abe76ba4690fad77c8a1da5945bb03cf005d64d393333ff57d23c390b6",
      "translation_text_hash": "d589eac610b13294a2de56a0ea038adee90dcf8d61f53a2fb99a0ae55ede5952",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
