      "en": "Now when all the Moabites heard that the kings had come up to fight against them, they gathered themselves together, all who were able to put on armor, young and old, and stood on the border.",
      "ko": "모압 모든 사람이 왕들이 올라와서 자기를 치려 한다 함을 듣고 갑옷 입을만한 자로부터 그 이상이 다 모여 그 경계에 섰더라",
      "source_text_hash": "f85734b555233aaf891a1e5163f64bc5834e529c53b181b3734aa93963aceaed",
      "translation_text_hash": "0e1a40ca2c3fbfe8d110015c1cd5c3e1c9f5b1a6dced087cf087777a3ee1cc37",
