      "en": "They rose up early in the morning, and the sun shone on the water, and the Moabites saw the water opposite them as red as blood.",
      "ko": "아침에 모압 사람이 일찌기 일어나서 해가 물에 비취므로 맞은편 물이 붉어 피와 같음을 보고",
      "source_text_hash": "bdb6fa479ca1b77b1d82cfc390d9e379649dd6b407fa1c0f0c765d6180e1da21",
      "translation_text_hash": "341c7f67036b3eb053a524e558f550adb3bd7e0abe805d1a755aca9d67cd3698",
