      "en": "They said, “This is blood. The kings are surely destroyed, and they have struck each other. Now therefore, Moab, to the plunder!”",
      "ko": "가로되 이는 피라 필연 저 왕들이 싸워 서로 죽인 것이로다 모압 사람들아 이제 노략하러 가자 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "7d961128285e4057c8d6718fb0960e739e81650c1fac77745ac005ec63c666e3",
      "translation_text_hash": "d29c6c7db7fcce55ade4616ff6e108028fc81ed239e9cdc109c56ecd346addd2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
